# Treinoway Service - Project Overview

Node.js backend API for a wellness/training platform. **Fastify 5**, **Prisma 7** ORM, **PostgreSQL 17**. ESM modules throughout.

## Common Commands

```bash
npm run setup      # Install deps, start DB, migrations, generate Prisma client
npm run dev        # Development server with hot reload
npm run test       # All tests
npm run test:unit  # Unit tests only (excludes e2e)
npm run test:e2e   # E2E tests (fresh Postgres container)
npm run lint       # ESLint
npm run lint:fix   # ESLint with auto-fix

# Database
npm run db:start   # Start PostgreSQL Docker container
npm run db:stop    # Stop container
npm run db:migrate # Run Prisma migrations (dev)
npm run db:generate # Regenerate Prisma Client
npm run db:studio  # Prisma Studio GUI (localhost:5555)
npm run db:reset   # Reset database (deletes all data)
```

## Environment

- **Node.js 24+** and **Docker** required
- PostgreSQL on port **5433** (not 5432)
- Copy `.env.example` to `.env` for local development
- `DISABLE_EMAIL=true` skips email (Resend) — always true in tests
- Email: Resend (`src/config/email-handler.js`)

## CI/CD

GitHub Actions: `lint.yml`, `unit-tests.yml`, `e2e-tests.yml`. Pre-commit: Husky + lint-staged (ESLint on staged JS/TS).
